WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.087
Have you ever wondered what it's like when Allah multiplies your good deeds ten times... or even more?

2
00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:12.075
Listen, you're working hard every day... but are you truly seeing the massive weight of your silent prayers?

3
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:14.275
Think about it like this.

4
00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:19.387
You give a single coin in charity... therefore, a vast garden begins to grow.

5
00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:22.262
The Prophet explained a stunning reality.

6
00:00:22.262 --> 00:00:27.600
When you do a good deed, Allah multiplies it ten times over... without fail.

7
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.287
He stated,


1
00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:33.320
كُلُّ عَمَلِ ابْنِ آدَمَ يُضَاعَفُ


1
00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:38.361
Every deed of the son of Adam is multiplied)... ten to seven hundred times.

2
00:00:38.311 --> 00:00:45.298
Now, that's just the starting point... because Allah loves generosity so much, He adds even more to your scale.

3
00:00:45.298 --> 00:00:50.811
You might think your small acts don't matter... but they're piling up in ways you wouldn't ever believe.

4
00:00:50.811 --> 00:00:57.561
Every single smile you share with your brother... counts as charity, and it's multiplied instantly by His grace.

5
00:00:57.561 --> 00:01:04.311
You plant a tiny seed of kindness today... therefore, you'll reap an unimaginable reward on the Day of Judgment.

6
00:01:04.311 --> 00:01:09.673
Don't ever hold back your good deeds... because they're the only currency that will save you in the end.

7
00:01:09.673 --> 00:01:16.636
Start stacking your blessings right now... because your Lord is waiting to shower you with rewards beyond your imagination.

8
00:01:16.636 --> 00:01:21.048
Follow for more authentic Islamic reminders... every single day!


